  <notes>The year figures in the left margin are marginal notes, each set beside its group. The bracketed italic line is printed within the list. The name "Vbbena" in the first group and "Ybbena" in the 1593 group are as far as I can read them; the first letter may be Y in both. "Vlger" and "Vpkena" are copied with the printed V. Reading of "men-dacis" at the line end is doubtful; the printed hyphenated form is hard to make out. "Nassavijs" and "Nassovijs" were normalised to i/j rules as vowel i. "Upslachtum" and "GUIL. LUD." were normalised from V to U per the vowel rule.</notes>
